OL,3,AMigraines and acne among five more
OL,4,Aconditions pharmacists can treat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople will be able to go to their
OL,7,Flocal chemist in England this autumn
OL,8,Fand get on-the-spot treatment for 12
OL,9,Fcommon conditions without going to
OL,10,Ftheir GP first.
OL,12,FPharmacists can already prescribe
OL,13,Fmedication for seven conditions - sore
OL,14,Fthroat, earache, sinusitis, shingles,
OL,15,Fimpetigo, infected bites and urinary
OL,16,Ftract infections.
OL,18,FFive more - migraines, acne, scabies,
OL,19,Fear infections and badly blocked noses
OL,20,F- are now also being added to that
OL,21,Flist.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
