OL,3,A'My cancer spread while I waited months
OL,4,Afor surgery': The cost of England's
OL,5,Acancer wait times
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlan was diagnosed with lung cancer
OL,8,Fafter a nodule was found in June last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe 70-year-old was meant to be
OL,12,Foperated on within weeks but ended up
OL,13,Fwaiting nearly five months, by which
OL,14,Ftime the cancer had spread, making his
OL,15,Fsurgery more complex.
OL,17,F"I was so frustrated and angry and
OL,18,Fcouldn't understand why they would
OL,19,Fleave me like that," says Alan.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
