OL,3,A'My cancer spread while I waited months
OL,4,Afor surgery': The cost of England's
OL,5,Acancer wait times
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn two occasions, scans were cancelled
OL,8,Fbecause machines had broken and for
OL,9,Fweeks he heard little or nothing from
OL,10,Fthe hospital about when he would
OL,11,Feventually have the urgent surgery.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
