OL,3,AIran war won't end until after crucial
OL,4,ANovember elections, says Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe made the comments as he headed to
OL,7,FTexas for the party's first-ever
OL,8,Fmidterm election convention - and
OL,9,Frepeated it there, arguing that
OL,10,Fshort-term economic pain was worth it
OL,11,Fto prevent Tehran from developing
OL,12,Fnuclear weapons.
OL,14,FTrump is facing falling polling numbers
OL,15,Fand pressure from within his Republican
OL,16,FParty to end the war with Iran.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
